# Pairs with SeedCovered (review C1: open, then seed). A seed stamped with the
# shard's generation is excluded from the unstamped watermark; with no token open
# there are no close heads to hold its owner on, so a leaf that can own it may
# pass it unread.
MODULE: SeedCoveredSeedWithoutMarker
TARGET: SeedCovered
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a never-written load stamps its seed with the shard's generation although no switch token is open
PERTURBS: Create
BOUNDS: NeverWritten = 1

--- FIND
    /\ seedGen' = IF tokOpen THEN gen ELSE 0
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: stamped whatever the token.
    /\ seedGen' = gen
--- END
